204030/extras/66ee04af3c6aebf8fccaabdb09cecbf0.avif?t=1733372236\" data-has-big width=800 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204030/extras/baef0a6e6200d4113c1dcd4b44cf1475.avif?t=1733372236\" data-has-big width=800 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[TellTale] features a total of 10 unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players investigate the incident, find out the interests of those involved, and uncover hidden secrets.</p>",
